---
/**
 * AffiliateDisclosure — the mandatory disclosure block shown on every
 * page that carries affiliate links. Tone (per the design system) is
 * calm and informational, not shouty.
 */
---
<aside class="disclosure" role="note" aria-label="Affiliate disclosure">
  <strong>Disclosure.</strong> SleekDrops earns a commission when you click affiliate links — at no extra cost to you. Our reviews are independent. We test the product before linking it.
</aside>

<style>
  .disclosure {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .disclosure strong { color: var(--ink); }
</style>
